WEBVTT

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:41.440
Nice!

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.270
Can't get enough!

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:46.870
Oh Setra.

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.480
Alright!

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:50.540
Guess I'll go and dance as well. {TLC: }

00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:54.810
What a nice sight. So nice!

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.420
Oh no! Setra-sama!

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:00.040
How naughty!

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:02.090
Can't get enough!

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:05.550
I'm... thirsty. {Alt: My throat... is parched.}

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:11.560
I present you grape wine from the Otran Company, which will be ours soon. {@TLC Not sure about the first part}

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:14.020
Hmm...

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:15.810
Which one should I pick?

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:17.260
Well then...

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:19.330
I'll have that girl.

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:21.860
Thank you very much, Princess.

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:36.240
It is such an honor, Princess.

00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:39.110
Delicious.

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:44.470
We're finally here.

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:47.330
So this is Menace's new country.

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:51.230
When we were walking through the desert, I thought I'd melt away. {TLC:  When we were walking through the desert, I thought I'd just melt away.}

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:52.740
Oh my.

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:55.000
You actually are melting.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.110
No way.

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:57.520
I really am!

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:04.200
But you know... this really isn't fun.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:07.370
Menace's enjoying life by herself.

00:02:07.370 --> 00:02:10.130
How did she even manage to revive the Kingdom of Amara?

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:12.700
In the first place, where did she get that money? {TLC: Where did she get that sort of money in the first place ?}

00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:16.130
It seems that during Queen's Blade,

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:19.450
there was a gift merchant who made a lot of money selling dolls of fighters.

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:23.010
He might be donating the vast majority of his funds.

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:24.240
Dolls?

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:26.860
Wow!

00:02:26.860 --> 00:02:29.110
What a wonderful doll!

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:30.920
Ain't that bad? {TLC's weird alt: That's not very nice, isn't it}

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:35.400
Making easy money off these dolls without permission from the original? {TLC alt: You will get hurt if you don't seek permission from the originals}

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:39.090
The princess may not look like it but she is strict about copyrights. {@TLC Middle part wut?}  {The princess may not look like it but she is strict about copyrights}

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:47.510
That's why, for the sake of the Amara Kingdom, you will offer these to us. {That's why, for the sake of the Amara Kingdom, you will offer these to us.}

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:51.160
While you're at it, throw in a hundred cute girls.

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:52.730
Come on buddy, do it for me!

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:56.470
... or something like that.

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:57.950
Probably.

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:04.180
The revival of the Amara Kingdom is one thing, but going against Master's will is the real problem. {TLC alt: I am thinking of The revival of the Amara Kingdom is the least of our worries, the main problem lies in defying the Master's will}

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:07.970
We have to convince her by any means possible to return to the swamp.

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:10.710
But this is Menace we're talking about.

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:13.470
I don't think she'd listen to us and do what we say.

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:15.320
Acting so lax again... {TLC alt: Being so carefree about it again}

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:18.950
The time limit Master gave us is three days.

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:21.470
If it comes down to it, we'll use force.

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:23.360
We don't have to be in such a hurry.

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:28.680
It'll be fine as long as we bring Menace back. {}

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:30.440
Let's just have fun doing it.

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:32.580
Tasty!

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:36.600
Now then! Lo and behold!

00:03:37.590 --> 00:03:42.760
What I have here is the pride of our premier iron mines, a golden javelin!

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:48.780
Our artisans pour their souls into crafting every one of these javelins.

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:52.730
Then each one is engraved with a protective charm in a nearby village. Such quality!

00:03:53.220 --> 00:03:57.850
And for all of you here right now, I'll give you a special price!

00:03:57.850 --> 00:04:01.280
This can be all yours for a mere 200 gold coins! {literal alt: I'll sell it to you for a mere 200 gold coins.}

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:02.720
That's expensive...

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:05.400
No matter how well it's made, that's too much.

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:08.450
Come on, don't be so hasty.

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:09.210
What's this?

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:12.400
With this javelin, you'll also receive...

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:16.270
a second javelin to go with the first!

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:18.280
Just irresistible to you men, no?

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:20.490
You should've offered them at half price from the start.

00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:21.880
I don't need two of them.

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:22.890
Yeah, you said it!

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:28.160
H-Hey, where are you going? This is the bargain of a lifetime! {Literal: This is a great buy/bargain!}

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:30.140
You won't ever get this chance again! {literal alt: You won't ever get your hands on this again!}

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:34.780
For today only, I'll give you free armor plate samples to go with your purchase! {@TLC Dunno about the 2 words that come after koutetsu} {TLC Alt: For today only, I am going to give armor plate samples as a secondary service}

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:37.570
Hey! Heeeeey!

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:38.930
So disappointing...

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:42.190
It looks like your business isn't doing very well. {Alt: Looks like business isn't doing/going too well//Looks like you're having some trouble with business.} {TLC choice XD It looks like your business isn't doing very well.}

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:46.310
Oh, it's you all.

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:48.550
Are you up to more evildoing?

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:50.550
How rude.

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:54.770
We just came to bring some excitement to this continent.

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:58.290
And you, why are you here in this desert? {cuz she's a sandnigger lawl} {XD XD Sandnigger} {TLC alt: How about you ? Why are you here in a desert like this ?}

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:02.060
As you can see, I'm here for business!

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:07.210
I heard about a founding of a new town, so if there are customers,

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:10.590
it's only natural for a businessman to go no matter where they are!

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:13.780
And where exactly are these customers?

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:15.950
N-No one asked you! {Alt: Mind your own business!}

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:16.580
Hmph.

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:32.820
What? The one ruling over this town is Menace?

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:36.420
However, most of the talk around town speaks highly of her.

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:38.530
Huh? You're kidding.

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:40.990
Then isn't she doing whatever wants?

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:45.570
That might be so, but everyone in the town adores the Princess.

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:47.780
I haven't heard anything even close to a complaint.

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:50.770
Unbelievable.

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:54.900
Who are the other servants apart from Setra? {lol TLC:  Who are the other servants apart from Setra ?}

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:57.470
She's the type to say stuff like that.

00:05:57.680 --> 00:05:59.630
Why do people adore her?

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:02.220
There's no point in asking me.

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:08.070
Look, that's your shortcut to the palace.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:10.150
Get on that boat.

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:11.660
Now then...

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:13.630
This is as far as I go.

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:19.110
I don't know what the three of you'll do once Menace joins, but don't go overboard. {alt: everything in moderation} {Menace}

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:20.310
Where are you off to?

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:27.220
I'll be going back to Gainos to forge a weapon for the new queen Claudette.

00:06:27.430 --> 00:06:28.710
For Claudette?

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:29.890
That's right.

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:33.520
If I say it's a favor to Reina, then she won't refuse.

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:39.010
No matter what official action the army may take, our iron mines will be safe and secure.

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:41.320
Mwahahaha!

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:41.820
She's insanely greedy.

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:43.500
Mwahahaha!

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:43.480
Way too greedy in fact.

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:44.980
I'm off now! {I'm off to take care of my own business}

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:57.290
Isn't that...

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:00.120
Amazing!

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:01.330
It's huge! {inb4 awkward fansubbing line} {XD not that awkard actually I think}

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:08.740
Oh?

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:10.120
You guys... {TLC alt: You guys are....}

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:13.500
Setra, we've found you at last.

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:16.050
Finally got us, haven't ya?

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:18.030
Setra, yahoo!

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:20.170
Yahoo, Melona!

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.250
Hey, Princess! {Standard then: "Princess" instead of mistress}

00:07:23.650 --> 00:07:26.100
Got some bothersome guests here, hey! {TLC alt: We have some troublesome guests here, hey !}

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:26.970
Princess, I'm talking to you! {Princess}

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:28.600
Yes?

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:39.280
I welcome you for coming here.

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:45.070
I am... the princess of the reborn Amara Kingdom, Menace. {Amara Kingdom}

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:46.790
We know.

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:49.830
Wow, you have quite a lot of attendants.

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:51.390
Oh?

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:55.510
For servants, they sure seem to be missing the symbol on their foreheads.{Alt: These servants don't have any symbols around on their foreheads.//I don't see any symbols on the foreheads of these servants. }

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:58.340
I've stopped doing that now.

00:07:59.030 --> 00:08:02.780
A princess doesn't force and control subjects to obey her.

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:06.060
Everyone's serving her out of their own free will.

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:07.570
Is that true?

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.690
Hey, hey you guys. {TLC: hey, you all perhaps ?}

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:11.600
Why are you serving Menace?

00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:14.890
It's because the Princess is a wonderful person.

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:17.000
I can only be grateful to her.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:19.240
Eternal happiness lies with her.

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:24.310
Anyway, forget about that.

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:27.490
Menace, Master has given us orders. {Literal alt: Menace, Master's orders:}

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:30.190
She wants us to return to the swamp immediately.

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:31.170
I don't want to.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:34.460
Master's orders are absolute.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:37.700
Hey now, Princess said she didn't want to.

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.910
If this is about her debt from being resurrected,

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:43.680
she should've already paid it back when she handed over the Amara Kingdom's treasure. {the Amara Kingdom's}

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:47.640
If that's how you're going to be...

00:08:47.910 --> 00:08:50.210
I'll bring you back by force if need be.

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:54.040
You picking a fight, you maid among maids?

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:57.390
You should know how strong Princess is.

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:59.830
That doesn't matter to me.

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:02.860
I'm only following Master's orders.

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:04.370
Here I come!

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:05.620
But you know...

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:08.470
What now?

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:10.620
Hey Menace.

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:14.540
Is living like a princess really that nice?

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:17.730
Yes, it is!

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:20.400
Each day is so luxurious.

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:25.600
Everyone, bow down before the supremacy of the Amara Kingdom! {Amara Kingdom}

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:35.830
I see.

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:36.730
Alright.

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:38.400
Airi.

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:40.790
I'm joining Menace's side.

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:41.070
Huh?

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:45.250
Well, this place seems more fun than the swamp.

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:45.720
W...

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:47.710
What are you saying?

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:48.820
You silly fool. {TLC alt: That fool is....}

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:50.520
Okay!

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:53.640
If this is how it's gonna be, tonight we party!

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:55.850
Everyone, go make preparations.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:58.710
Girls, follow my lead!

00:10:00.590 --> 00:10:03.370
Please wait, Setra-sama!

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:04.450
Setra-sama!

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:08.670
I've always wanted to do this!

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:10.970
Melona.

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:12.510
What in the world are you thinking?

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:17.360
The weather's so nice.

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:27.610
That was fun.

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:34.910
The crab and the lobster were both so good.

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:36.880
Right, Airi?

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:38.570
I don't know what you're talking about. {Alt: Like I would know.}

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:40.310
Don't look so sour.

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:44.180
We prepared all those beautiful girls' life forces just for you.

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:49.640
Suck however much you want, 'kay?

00:10:50.890 --> 00:10:54.380
Y-You... can't win me over with something like that. {alt: Y-You... can't win me over by something like that.}

00:10:54.560 --> 00:10:59.090
For the most part, life force consumed without resistance is pointless.{=}

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:00.850
But you did suck them, didn't you?

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:03.470
You must have been hungry.

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:11.170
M-more importantly, Menace and Melona, tomorrow you're both going back to Master.

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:15.600
We have to quickly prepare and start selecting the number of fighters.

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:17.290
We can't keep playing around...

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:18.820
I don't want to.

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:20.170
Me neither!

00:11:20.630 --> 00:11:22.990
You don't have the right to refuse. {Less formal alt: You don't get to say no.}

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:25.900
I'll definitely bring the both of you back with me!

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:28.050
Well in that case...

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:32.650
How about having a contest to see how much grape wine you can drink?

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:35.510
If the maid wins, we don't mind going back to the swamp.

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:36.880
Grape wine?

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:39.470
I have no idea what that is.

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:40.950
Looks fun.

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:42.850
Count me in.

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:44.860
And what will you do?

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:46.260
I...

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:47.750
I understand.

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:50.670
I accept your challenge.

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:54.980
The rules are simple.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:59.000
Whoever can drink the most grape wine is the winner.

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:01.210
'Kay, start!

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:15.870
We got as much wine as you want!

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:17.180
Drink 'till you drop!

00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:18.580
Drink and know!

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:20.430
Drink and feel like paradise!

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:22.400
Ah, delicious.

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:35.080
Airi, are you going to be okay after drinking that much?

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:36.300
Ha?

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:39.140
Mind your own business!

00:12:39.560 --> 00:12:41.890
For Master's sake...

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:45.560
I... definebuly won't lose! {definitely misspelled on purpose}

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:49.110
So hooot....

00:12:50.730 --> 00:12:51.940
Airi-san.

00:12:52.060 --> 00:12:54.170
You're quite a bad drunk. {TLC - Thinking of : Your alcohol tolerance is bad}

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:57.210
Alright!

00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:59.720
I guess I'll strip too!

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:02.900
Well, ain't this nice!

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:04.090
Ok! {@TLC No idea what he's saying. Random JP sound?} {Sounds like - ok XD}

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:11.990
I wonder if it's okay to leave her alone after this.

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:14.370
No complaints{objections} here.

00:13:15.990 --> 00:13:17.910
Princess, you're awesome!

00:13:18.350 --> 00:13:19.900
Geeeez.

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:21.910
Master...

00:13:22.060 --> 00:13:25.450
I'll bring Menace back with me...

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:35.630
Good morning Airi.

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:36.760
Good day.

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:38.910
M-Menace.

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:43.220
Today's the day we're going back to the swamp.

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:45.520
I bet your head hurts, doesn't it?

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:46.470
W...

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:48.300
Why do you...

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:51.950
It'll take around 2 days to cure that.

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:54.190
How surprising.

00:13:54.190 --> 00:14:00.370
Airi, you know, I've spent an entire day living a life of royalty, so...

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:02.810
S-Stop joking around.

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:05.810
We have to return to Master as fast as we can.

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:11.090
Rushing back the way you are right now is out of the question.

00:14:11.320 --> 00:14:13.650
Besides, if you go back looking like that,

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:16.760
the Swamp Witch might punish you again.

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:19.550
Princess.

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:21.240
The gift merchant has arrived.

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:22.100
Is that so?

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:24.270
Ooh, he's here?

00:14:24.270 --> 00:14:26.850
Princess, I'm gonna go do my job.

00:14:27.180 --> 00:14:28.580
Okay.

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:30.020
Keep up the good work.

00:14:33.820 --> 00:14:35.310
How do you like these?{liberal alt: See anything you like?//Do you like what you see?}

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:39.660
This time, I'd like to introduce this lineup of fighters, but... {So... what I think is happening here is that apparently these guys are making some sort of doll/showoff of the fighters or something? Anyway, that's what I'm going to base my editing off of}

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:47.160
Ooh, the seasoned mercenary Echidna, the Assassin of the Fang Irma, and finally the Guardian of the Forest Nowa?

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:49.490
Why not, why not!

00:14:50.390 --> 00:14:51.880
However!

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:55.820
Can't you make Nowa a tiny bit more erotic?

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:58.100
Make that tight skirt shorter!

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:02.450
And make sure Irma's clothes don't cover her too much! {@TLC not sure about the naru modifier} {Irma's clothing don't cover her too much}

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:04.770
By that you mean...?

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:09.390
When you use this low quality material, it'll make her look more clothed than it should.

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:12.310
And can you get rid of this snake on Echidna?

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:14.180
No... it's attached. {}

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:16.040
You stupid fool!

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:19.320
How much d'you think Echnida be worth without her snake?

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:20.910
Think more about your customer's needs!

00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:25.020
I'm terribly sorry! I'll make the necessary improvements at once! {@TLC 2nd half unsure} {}

00:15:25.700 --> 00:15:28.260
Is this also a job for royalty?

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:30.460
It's a very important industry.

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:39.090
A royal lifestyle must be nothing short of luxurious.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:48.270
It's like you've become lost in the eternal flow of time...

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:52.240
you pass everyday in peace without a care in the world. {Alt: You just relax and peacefully pass the time.}

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:54.210
I see...

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:58.250
You won't be "seeing" anything.

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:05.080
Menace.

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:06.830
It feels so good.

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:08.850
I know, right?

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:11.250
It's so addicting.

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:14.560
Hey now.

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:17.620
Listen when a person's talking to you!

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:18.980
Oh?

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:21.380
Airi-san, <i>are</i> you a person?

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:23.430
Aren't you a ghost?

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:26.670
So, are you okay now?

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:29.350
Thanks to you, I'm all better now.

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:31.030
Now then...

00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:34.770
This time for sure, I'll have you return back to Master.

00:16:35.190 --> 00:16:36.740
Leave that alone for now...

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:39.490
Airi-san, would you like to have an oil massage?

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:42.720
That's a good idea.

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:46.170
What?

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:47.920
What are you doing?

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:57.280
Take your time.

00:16:57.280 --> 00:16:59.630
We'll be leaving first, Airi.

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:01.560
Geez.

00:17:03.930 --> 00:17:07.070
Excuse me... but please,

00:17:07.070 --> 00:17:09.960
could you not take Princess Menace away?

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:13.360
The princess is our sun!

00:17:15.640 --> 00:17:20.990
No matter what happens, I'm only acting on Master's orders.

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:30.280
Royal life isn't all about luxury.

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:33.860
Training to protect the country is one important aspect. {=}

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:36.260
You sure it's okay to go all out?

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:37.940
Yes.

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:40.170
It's been a while, so fight seriously. {TLC alt: I will go all out in order to protect my country}

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:42.950
Well then, all out it is!

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:44.510
Just wait a minute.

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:47.220
I have a proposal to offer.

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:48.980
What now?

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:51.320
I was finally in the mood to fight. {Alt: I was finally in the mood to fight.}

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:53.890
I'd like for the two of you to promise me something.

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:58.030
If Melona wins, Menace goes back to the swamp.

00:17:58.380 --> 00:18:02.980
If Menace wins, Melona and I will give our full cooperation.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:04.570
How does that sound?

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:07.770
Mmm... fine with me.

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:10.280
I don't mind either.

00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:12.450
W-Wait!

00:18:12.450 --> 00:18:15.740
No matter who loses, isn't the maid among maids the real wi-

00:18:18.550 --> 00:18:19.960
So we're all clear?

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:21.500
If so, start!

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:28.830
There's more coming!

00:18:29.910 --> 00:18:31.190
Yes!

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:34.010
How's this?

00:18:35.270 --> 00:18:36.730
You missed!

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:38.810
Looking good!

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:41.190
Go at it you two, go!

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:50.030
Menace, you've gotten even stronger.

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:54.260
You too Melona. Your improved transformations overwhelmed me.

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:56.950
Oh no, not at all. It was a draw.

00:18:57.620 --> 00:18:59.220
You did it on purpose...

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:00.030
I'm sure of it...

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:01.630
Nah, it wasn't!

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:07.290
The time limit Master gave us lasts for only one more day.

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:10.340
We can't afford any more delays.

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:20.520
You two. {TLC alt: The both of you.}

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:24.760
By the end of tonight, I <i>will</i> have you return to Master.

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:26.470
That again? {Liberal alt: You still on about that?}

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:28.000
I've told you already.

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:31.320
For now, both Menace and I won't be going back to the swamp.

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:33.990
If you want to go back, go by yourself. {go alone}

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:36.120
You leave me no choice.

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:41.920
If that's how it's going to be, is okay if I tell Master what you said the other day?

00:19:44.190 --> 00:19:45.800
The other day?

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:47.050
Let me think...

00:19:47.590 --> 00:19:51.140
To be honest, as long as I have fun,

00:19:51.140 --> 00:19:53.850
I couldn't care less about the Swamp Witch.

00:19:53.850 --> 00:19:56.770
I wasn't even loyal to her in the first place.

00:19:58.060 --> 00:19:59.240
Did I get that right?

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:02.320
I... I don't know what you're talking about.

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:06.410
Besides, I was the first and foremost follower of the Swamp Witch{minions}.

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:08.900
She won't believe anything you say.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:10.530
I wonder about that.

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:16.830
So Menace, what that means is...

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:18.770
The fun ends here.

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:24.210
If you don't hurry up and head back to the Swamp Witch, I won't show you any mercy.

00:20:26.470 --> 00:20:28.610
Such a quick change of heart.

00:20:28.980 --> 00:20:32.250
You <i>will</i> come back, right? Menace... {TLC alt: You will return, right ? Menace...}

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:34.910
No means no. {Liberal alt: No means no.}

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:37.280
Then I'll have to force you!

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:44.620
How mean, Airi.

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:47.160
Are you really under that much pressure?

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:50.620
Shining Pyramid!

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:10.720
That's the best I can do for now. {TLC  - I think: "That's the best I can do for now"}

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:12.930
Melona.

00:21:14.280 --> 00:21:16.290
Go, lower level spirits! {She adds tachi this time, so it's more of an order to the spirits rather than SHOUT MY SKILL NAME! I used ONC's TL from the previous ep} {TLC - XD}

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:25.770
Now!

00:21:28.070 --> 00:21:29.880
Caught you.

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:32.810
Melona-san.

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:34.490
Please get off me.

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:43.700
Oh, not so fast!

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:50.480
Here I go!

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:57.880
I'm not done yet.

00:21:59.430 --> 00:22:00.580
Princess!

00:22:08.740 --> 00:22:10.190
Curse...

00:22:10.570 --> 00:22:12.650
Slap! {-______-} {TLC response I feel like its "Curse Slap" >.< but -_- indeed }

00:22:20.010 --> 00:22:21.060
You're open!

00:22:22.850 --> 00:22:24.330
Is this it? {alt: Is this it?//Is this the end?}

00:22:25.340 --> 00:22:26.580
Far from over!

00:22:27.460 --> 00:22:28.580
Stop, you can't...

00:22:29.690 --> 00:22:33.040
Curse Punch! {TLC response: Curse Punch !}

00:22:40.730 --> 00:22:43.520
Princess, don't! The backdrop's collapsing!

00:22:43.520 --> 00:22:44.390
Run!

00:23:00.420 --> 00:23:01.420
This is...

00:23:05.050 --> 00:23:07.860
Huh? What happened?

00:23:08.020 --> 00:23:09.720
You saw it, didn't you? {TLC: You saw it, didn't you}

00:23:10.100 --> 00:23:13.220
Even though the gift merchant made so much money,

00:23:13.220 --> 00:23:17.250
building the castle gates at the river mouth used up all of the money. {@TLC not sure} {TLC response : Building the castle gates at the river mouth alone used up all of the money}

00:23:17.720 --> 00:23:20.020
And that's why you had the backdrop?

00:23:20.020 --> 00:23:21.300
How lame.

00:23:21.980 --> 00:23:25.780
Those who've learned of the secret of the reborn Amara Kingdom... {Amara Kingdom}

00:23:25.780 --> 00:23:27.800
shall not be allowed to live!

00:23:30.750 --> 00:23:33.030
I won't let you escape!

00:23:36.490 --> 00:23:38.910
Princess, that looks bad!

00:23:39.010 --> 00:23:40.680
The fire's going to ignite the oil!

00:23:47.330 --> 00:23:48.700
Melt away!

00:23:56.440 --> 00:23:58.210
So unforgivable!

00:23:59.240 --> 00:24:00.440
Both of you...

00:24:00.440 --> 00:24:06.530
Bow down before the supremacy of the Amara Kingdom! {Amara Kingdom}

00:24:20.390 --> 00:24:22.290
Sorry Menace.

00:24:22.290 --> 00:24:23.850
We sort of overdid it.

00:24:23.850 --> 00:24:25.500
We feel bad about it.

00:24:25.940 --> 00:24:27.880
There's no helping it.

00:24:27.980 --> 00:24:30.910
I couldn't make any difference.

00:24:31.670 --> 00:24:33.970
Everyone's gone now too.

00:24:33.970 --> 00:24:37.940
In the end the revival of the Amara Kingdom still has a long way to go. {TLC alt : In the end the revival of the Amara Kingdom still has a long way to go}

00:24:38.290 --> 00:24:39.940
Princess!

00:24:40.240 --> 00:24:41.900
Princess! Princess!

00:24:41.900 --> 00:24:43.140
Are you alright?

00:24:43.140 --> 00:24:44.210
Princess!

00:24:44.210 --> 00:24:45.670
Princess!

00:24:44.910 --> 00:24:46.070
You guys!

00:24:46.070 --> 00:24:47.810
The servants?

00:24:48.600 --> 00:24:53.020
Princess, as long as you are okay, we can revive the Amara Kingdom anytime! {Amara Kingdom}

00:24:53.020 --> 00:24:55.900
Let us rebuild the royal palace at once.

00:24:55.900 --> 00:24:58.430
For that, we need some money first.

00:24:58.700 --> 00:25:00.580
Call the gift merchant here!

00:25:00.580 --> 00:25:01.410
Right away!

00:25:03.030 --> 00:25:05.340
Work hard, everyone!

00:25:05.850 --> 00:25:08.680
Getting Menace to go now is impossible.

00:25:08.910 --> 00:25:10.280
Seems like it.

00:25:10.460 --> 00:25:13.250
But you know... somehow that's okay.

00:25:18.130 --> 00:25:22.020
In the end, who were those people?

00:25:22.020 --> 00:25:26.600
If you're talking about the servants, aren't they all just huge masochists?

00:25:26.740 --> 00:25:27.740
Huge masochists?

00:25:27.960 --> 00:25:30.880
That means they're perverts who like being teased.

00:25:35.220 --> 00:25:36.530
Come on, Princess.

00:25:36.530 --> 00:25:38.690
Swing that whip a bit more.

00:25:39.040 --> 00:25:41.700
Uhm... like this?

00:25:42.430 --> 00:25:44.070
One more time!

00:25:46.670 --> 00:25:47.840
Doing well!

00:25:47.840 --> 00:25:49.720
Hit 'em more!

00:25:49.720 --> 00:25:50.160
Okay!

00:25:50.160 --> 00:25:51.750
Come on, more!

00:25:51.890 --> 00:25:53.030
Princess, how's it feel?

00:25:53.030 --> 00:25:56.560
Oh, this kind-of excites me a little!

00:25:56.950 --> 00:25:59.330
I thought it was strange...

00:25:59.760 --> 00:26:02.660
...for people to be serving her without a symbol.

00:26:03.060 --> 00:26:04.580
I guess you're right.

00:26:05.330 --> 00:26:09.610
But... it might not only be that.

00:26:09.610 --> 00:26:10.300
Huh?

00:26:11.820 --> 00:26:13.540
What did you say?

00:26:13.540 --> 00:26:15.020
I wanna know!

00:26:15.020 --> 00:26:18.980
More importantly, how are we going to report this to the Swamp Witch?

00:26:18.980 --> 00:26:19.860
Dunno.

00:26:19.860 --> 00:26:20.800
Huh?

00:26:20.300 --> 00:26:27.480
Revival!

00:26:20.300 --> 00:26:27.480
Menace's Royal
Palace of Pleasure!

00:26:20.800 --> 00:26:23.590
You must at least have some kind of idea?

00:26:23.590 --> 00:26:25.670
Nope, no, none at all!

00:28:34.860 --> 00:28:37.050
Princess, how long you gonna keep whipping?

00:28:37.050 --> 00:28:41.070
Setra, the servants aren't satisfied with this! {liberal alt: Setra, the servants haven't had enough!//Setra, the servants keep wanting more!}

00:28:41.070 --> 00:28:43.020
I'm so exhausted too.

00:28:43.670 --> 00:28:45.850
This totally reverses the master-servant roles.

00:28:45.850 --> 00:28:46.700
I know! {lib alt: Got an idea!}

00:28:46.700 --> 00:28:49.390
How about you go ahead one by one and take their money in a single strike? {@TLC This sentence doesn't make much sense to me context-wise. Is it some sort of pun with the line after the next?} {TLC response - Sounds weird but here: How about whipping them one by one instead of all at one go ?}

00:28:49.390 --> 00:28:51.230
That might work.

00:28:51.230 --> 00:28:54.100
Then I'll start with the richest one! Hiya!

00:28:54.580 --> 00:28:55.700
Who, me? {TLC alt: Hey ! That's me you are whipping}

00:28:55.700 --> 00:28:57.990
Next time: Fallen Angel! The Nanael of Pleasure!

00:28:57.990 --> 00:29:00.310
Princess, this seriously might become a habit. {alt: Mistress, I might seriously start to like this//Mistress, I seriously might want you to do this again.}
